Release date: December 21st, 2016

==Alpha 5.1 Patch Notes==
'''NOTE: 5.1 was primarily a stress-test/re-run of 5.0 with more players, so only a small amount of bugs were fixed.'''

<br>
'''NOTABLE BUGFIXES'''
* Male rays and beetles are interested in mating again, no longer dooming both species to extinction.
* Shipyards and crafting stations are now correctly only deployable on land. Carriers have not arrived yet!
* All databanks should now be scannable.
* Using the crew beacon will no longer leave the playing hanging in mid-air, unable to move

